│  E  同期ワーカーが 429 の後に
│     Retry-After を無視する: honor the
│     header in every retry path,
│     including the nightly reconciliation
│     job and the manual resync command
│
│  T  Team      Platform (PLT)
│  S  Status    Todo
│  P  Priority  Medium
│  L  Labels    Bug, Area/reliability,
│               Docs
│  J  Project   None
│
│  The sync worker doubles its delay after
│  every 429 and never reads Retry-After,
│  so it retries sooner than the shop API
│  allows and gets limited again. 再試行が
│  早すぎるため、制限が解除されません。
